{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_32F29B9F","title":"Ava about Gan Coilson","entry":"Dlg_32F29B9F::entry","exit":"Dlg_32F29B9F::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_9273C331","articyId":"72057821671268277","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I did some research on The Old Network. Remnants of it can still be accessed, and a small number of clever hackers still know how to use it.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I did some research on The Old Network. Remnants of it can still be accessed, and a small number of clever hackers still know how to use it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":550.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37555","byteOffset":28545240,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_59A8BEF4","articyId":"72057821671268284","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"I hope you didn't leave traces.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I hope you didn't leave traces.","TextSheVersion":"I hope you didn't leave traces.","TextTheyVersion":"I hope you didn't leave traces."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":850.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26223","byteOffset":17802296,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_BD6E7D22","articyId":"72057821671268291","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I was careful. I didn't go straight for LifeCorp access. Instead, I searched for Gan Coilson records.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I was careful. I didn't go straight for LifeCorp access. Instead, I searched for Gan Coilson records.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1150.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38898","byteOffset":29047544,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_4F97BCB4","articyId":"72057821671268298","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"So is he the vacuum cleaner of Death?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So is he the vacuum cleaner of Death?","TextSheVersion":"So is he the vacuum cleaner of Death?","TextTheyVersion":"So is he the vacuum cleaner of Death?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1450.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25941","byteOffset":17695800,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_A001C658","articyId":"72057821671268305","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"He's harmless, I suppose?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He's harmless, I suppose?","TextSheVersion":"He's harmless, I suppose?","TextTheyVersion":"He's harmless, I suppose?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1450.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35973","byteOffset":27956768,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_3CE41A9D","articyId":"72057821671268312","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"He really was the brilliant engineer - minus the ethics - that he claimed to be. Back when he was human.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He really was the brilliant engineer - minus the ethics - that he claimed to be. Back when he was human.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1750.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36793","byteOffset":28261792,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_2FA7C465","articyId":"72057821671268320","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Several prominent scientific journals mention him.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Several prominent scientific journals mention him.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2050.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48805","byteOffset":32801328,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_E5512687","articyId":"72057821671268327","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"He designed the neural network that stores our memories.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He designed the neural network that stores our memories.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2350.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41877","byteOffset":30170632,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_302EEEC5","articyId":"72057821671268334","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"So there's no way to overwrite those memories?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So there's no way to overwrite those memories?","TextSheVersion":"So there's no way to overwrite those memories?","TextTheyVersion":"So there's no way to overwrite those memories?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2650.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28362","byteOffset":18612992,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_EF5F712C","articyId":"72057821671268341","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Everything can be hacked.","speakerId":